# What never belongs in the build context.
#
# Not only size: `**/bin` and `**/obj` would carry one machine's build outputs
# into another machine's restore, and `**/node_modules` would silently defeat
# the frozen lockfile the image is built with.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.beads
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/build-native
# The Xcode and Gradle projects: the image ships the website only.
src/frontend/native
**/TestResults
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
# Local data (the data-protection key ring, config, recipe images) and tooling.
data
.claude
.idea
.pnpm-store
.agents
.codex
.code-review-graph
docs
*.md
